sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Server
    participant D as Database
    participant R as Redis Cache

    C->>A: GET /users/123
    A->>R: Check cache
    R-->>A: Cache miss
    A->>D: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id=123
    D-->>A: User record
    A->>R: Set cache
    A-->>C: 200 OK {user}
